Dependencies
------------

Rust crates (Cargo.lock): permissive licenses only (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD,
ISC, Zlib, Unicode and similar), as deny.toml enforces with cargo-deny. A
full list with each license text is generated with cargo-about:

  scripts/third-party-notices.sh > THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

JavaScript packages: the admin console (apps/admin) and the documentation
site (apps/docs) bundle npm packages, including IBM's Carbon Design System
(Apache-2.0) and React (MIT); their licenses are listed in each app's
package-lock.json and node_modules after `npm ci`.

Client libraries in clients/ declare their own dependencies in their
package manifests (Cargo.toml, pyproject.toml, go.mod, pom.xml, CMake).
